cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its derived aggregate results, please cite the
  associated manuscript and the archived software release.
title: "Probe-Side JPEG Compression in Face Verification: Reproducibility Artifact"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tan"
    given-names: "Aihong"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-01
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen configurations and aggregate validation artifacts for a
  five-split Color FERET study of probe-side JPEG compression, fixed
  operational thresholds, exhaustive non-mates, hard-impostor stress tests,
  subject-cluster bootstrap inference, multiplicity-adjusted degradation
  analysis and encoded-payload trade-offs.
keywords:
  - face verification
  - JPEG compression
  - Color FERET
  - biometric evaluation
  - false non-match rate
  - false match rate
  - reproducible research
